--------------------------------
21. WHY IS THIS USEFUL?
--------------------------------

Token-based authentication is useful when:

→ Login UI takes a long time
→ Many tests need the same authenticated user
→ We want to avoid repeating login steps
→ We want faster test execution
→ We want to combine API and UI testing


Example:

Instead of:

Test 1 → UI Login
Test 2 → UI Login
Test 3 → UI Login
Test 4 → UI Login


We can:

beforeAll()
    ↓
API Login once
    ↓
Get token
    ↓
Use token for UI tests


